      {
        "Parameter": "PE_G___NotesType",
        "Kind": "Value",
        "Value": "Source set from Wine Guardian DS050 product page, Sentinel split spec sheet, current ducted split manual, and SS050 condenser CAD PDF. Modeled with 1/4 in liquid and 1/2 in suction refrigerant connectors only; no duct connectors were added because this template targets the outdoor condenser. PE_E___Voltage is set to 230 V even though the unit is dual-rated 208/230 V, because the published performance footnote states capacities are tested at 230 V. Manual guidance used here: minimum 12 in perimeter clearance, maximum total line length 90 ft, and maximum lift 15 ft. Wine Guardian's current DS050 shop page contains conflicting max-capacity copy, so PE_M_PerfCool_CapacityRated was set to 6458 BTU/h from the additional-information table/spec sheet instead of the lower marketing blurbs."
      }
